Subject: [PATCH 1/4] brand: apply new V + circuit-branch logo across site

Replaces the old plain-V icon with the approved mark (two-tone
gradient V, layered depth, circuit-branch accent) in the header
brand lockup and the favicon. Fixes non-square image distortion by
switching brand-lockup img to auto height with object-fit: contain.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015BzRW24c5V8k2LN861T3TG
